Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人犯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...uh, Murderer Guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和地质学家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and geologists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你别傻了  你可爱聪明又体贴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you're being ridiculous. Okay? You are cute and smart and sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这比离婚三次重要多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and that is much more important than three stupid divorces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  你交过离婚三次的男朋友吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah? Have you dated anyone who's been divorced three times?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样问不公平  离三次婚的人通常都六十了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that’s not really fair. Y’know? Most guys who have been divorced three times are like 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有你自己在意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody cares about this except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么难堪啊  都是你在想像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This embarrassment thing is all in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我证明给你看  过来  干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here, I'll show you. Come here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我朋友罗斯即将三度离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Listen, My friend Ross is about to be divorced for the third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们会和他约会吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But wouldn't you date him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们稍候  我去找罗斯来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if you wait right here, I'll go get Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我还以为你是瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Agh. Thought you were Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪里露出破绽了  我得赶快告诉她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What gave me away? I just tell her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经告诉罗斯和菲比  只剩她了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to get it over with. I told Ross and Phoebe. She's the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以大家都知道了  我们确定要同居了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so that’s it, everybody knows! It's official. We're moving in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能反悔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕吗  怕吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you scared? Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我最可怕的声音  你真勇敢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was my scariest voice. You're brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Ugh. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天真惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The worst day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为自己终于受重视了  结果老板却叫你拉壳儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y’know, you think finally making progress at work, then your boss calls you Racquel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.63,0:07:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我进公司前四年  大家都叫我夏拉拉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey listen, for the first four years of my work everybody called me Sha-la-lap...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是真的  我相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously. I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时正在开员工大会  当然不会有人纠正她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, it was right in the middle of a staff meeting so of course no one else wants to correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是大家都叫我拉壳儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So everyone's calling me Racquel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到了下班前   收发室的人已经叫成洛基了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By the end of the day, the mailroom guys were calling me Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得你很好  很漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I still think you're very, very nice and very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交给你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All yours, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  钱德和我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, urn, Chandler and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要一起住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...are going to live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真替你们高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so happy for you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真好  还先问我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that was so sweet of you to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我们三个在一起一定会很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh my God, The three of us are gonna have such a good time living together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:08:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你早上不能慢慢冲澡了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Chandler, you’re gonna have to watch those long showers you take in the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为拉壳儿不能迟到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because you know Racquel can't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  他会注意的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach. He'll work on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好兴奋喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Aw, this is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来敲我的门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come and knock on our door
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等着你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll be waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧   一旦知道内情   就没那么糟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See? Once you know the stories, it's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次  老婆隐瞒性取向  不是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First marriage: Wife's hidden sexuality. Not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二次  宣誓时叫错人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Second marriage: Said the wrong name at the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一点点是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A little my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第三次  怎么能让\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Third marriage: well they really shouldn’t allow you get married...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脸上涂鸦的醉鬼结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...when you're drunk and have writing on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内华达州的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nevada's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得怎样  谁会没兴趣  谁会不想和他约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, So what do you think, ladies? Who wouldn’t be interested? Who wouldn't want to date him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离婚无所谓   我会和他约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well the divorces don’t bother me, I'd date him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他得先恢复自由身\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But not while he's still married.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢  你也想吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, what about you?  wouldn't you want a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.89,0:10:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上我再也不约会了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I'm not dating at all anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我老是看上对我不好的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, I figured out that I was only dating guys that were like y’know bad for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我解决这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I decided that until I work that--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧  随便啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Good. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅格  你呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about you, Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不在意离婚的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I don't care about the divorces either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会和他约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I wouldn't date him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他显然还爱着这个瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just that he's obviously still in love with this Rachel girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说  "他显然还爱着这个瑞秋"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She said, "He's obviously still in love with this Rachel girl."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这话太扯了  没错   瑞秋是我的好朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is crazy. I mean, yes, Rachel is my good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我过去确实爱过她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I have loved her in the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在  她只是我的妻子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but now, she is just my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  帮我说句话好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, will you help me out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你娶她时  我也以为你爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I thought you loved her when you-when you married her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们喝醉了  喝那么多我连乔伊都会娶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were drunk! I would've married Joey with that amount of alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  比乔伊崔比亚尼烂的人多得是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! You could do a lot worse than Joey Tribbiani!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:10:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  但是你们错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, but you guys are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.95,0:11:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想离三次婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just don't want to be divorced three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他以此为藉口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, and now he's using this three-divorces reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不想离婚  因为他爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because he wants to stay married to her because he loves her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须说  梅格  干得好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I must say, well done. Bravo, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  如果你们这么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Fine! Fine! If this is what you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就不管了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...forget about the whole three-divorce thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就去找律师办注销\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I-I’ll go to my lawyer’s office right now and get this marriage annulled. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我一点也不爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Noth-Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是你的神经质  让我发毛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now I wouldn't date you because you seem a little creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然觉得他好有魅力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so attracted to him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么时候要跟瑞秋说实话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, when are we gonna tell Rachel what is actually gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.37,0:11:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才说不出口  你也看到乔伊多难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just couldn't before. You saw how upset Joey got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不忍心伤害  我最好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't do it. She's my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊也是我最好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey's my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not your best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己刚才说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just said--!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course, you're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但请你告诉瑞秋  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you please tell Rachel? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  至少我现在有准备  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. At least I'm prepared. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yes. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是给你的  你有不开心吗  现在有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're not for you. Are you upset? I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, roomie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rash. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有重要的事  要告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's something, urn, important I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怀孕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  但我要扔掉这件衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, but I'm throwing this shirt away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才有一些误会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think there was a little misunderstanding before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说钱德和我想住在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I said that, uh, Chandler and I wanted to live together...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意思是只有我们两个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we meant alone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  真好笑  我居然会误会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. That's funny. I can't believe I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  亲爱的  都是我不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, sweetie. You know what? This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没说清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你可以慢慢找房子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, you take as much time as you need to move out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不用急\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's absolutely no rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不吃饼干吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you want a cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要面纸吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you need a tissue?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡  这是哪里的饼干  我做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, Where did you get these? I made them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪   真好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, they're so yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到家你人却不在   感觉一定会很奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, it’s gonna so weird like when I come home and you’re not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有乔伊和钱德家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y’know? No more Joey and Chan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有乔和钱家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No more J and C's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"要不要去乔伊和钱德家"  "不行  已经不在了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Want to go to Joey and Chandler's? Can't. It's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是搬到对面  我们还是可以跟以前一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I’m just gonna be across the hall, We can still do all the same stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但以后就不能半夜起来  促膝长谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We won't be able to like get up in the middle of the night and have those long talks...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的感觉和未来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about our feelings and the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一次也没做过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not once did we do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉瑞秋  我们要自己住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I told Rachel that it's just gonna be the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  她还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah? Well, how'd she take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really well. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令人意外的好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Surprisingly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有哭  也没有生气或难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She didn't cry. She wasn't angry or sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很不爽  没把你最好的朋友弄哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're upset because you didn't make your best friend cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只求一点真情流露\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All I'm asking for is just a little emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是六年室友啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that too much to ask after six years?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没你们要好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean what? Are-are-are Rachel and I not as close as you guys?! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没你们开心吗  我不值得她掉几滴泪吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, did we not have as much fun? Don't I deserve a few tears?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊一听到  就哭得死去活来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When we told Joey, he cried his eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我才没有哭得死去活来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! I did not cry my eyes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就像一个时代的结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, it's like the end of an era.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再也没有乔兄和钱哥了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No more J-Man and Channy's!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.97,0:14:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要问  有谁那样叫我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I gotta ask, who calls us that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got married again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你两年内第二次结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that's your second marriage in two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.87,0:15:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   两年两次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Second in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总共三次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Third, overall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我当了二十三年离婚律师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I have been a divorce attorney for 23 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有一个客户比你捧场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and never have I had so much business from one client.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,基本上   瑞秋和我在赌城   我们喝醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Basically, Rachel and I were in Vegas, and we got drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  她就是你上次结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, is this the same Rachel whose name you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫错的那个瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...at the altar in the second marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   对   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes, yes. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我并不爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I do not love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就好多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's better then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是酒醉犯错   我要办注销\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This was just a drunken mistake, and I need to get it annulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你考虑过接受治疗吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you considered therapy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想今天办注销就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think just the annulment for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要填几份表格  简单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There are some forms to fill out. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须有证人证明   你们当时神智不清\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll need witnesses who can testify that you were not of sound mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No problem. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和瑞秋得向法官说明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we'll need you and Rachel to testify before a judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能不找她吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no way to do this without her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经告诉她事情都办妥了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I kind of already told her it was taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.19,0:16:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  你可以这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你和瑞秋都在场  才能办理注销\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look Ross, you can't get an annulment unless you and Rachel are both there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那找一个长得像瑞秋的人呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about someone who looks like Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会考虑接受治疗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will think about the therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们应该开始分东西了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, um, I was thinking that maybe we should start dividing up our stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没必要拖拖拉拉的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No point in dragging it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你搬走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dragging out the long process of you moving out...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们分开的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and us not living together anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.98,0:17:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  这个要归谁啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about this? Who gets this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我想不想要  它有太多回忆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, I don't know if I want it because it might be too many memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is that? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大盘子呢  我要你留着大盘子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about this? I want you to have the big plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  莫妮卡  我很喜欢这个盘子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, Monica, thanks. I love this plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就会记得我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Something to remember me by.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又不是快死了  我只是要搬出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mon, you're not dying. I'm just moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.10,0:17:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是会常常见面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna see each other all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.89,0:17:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是个大转变\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But still, it's a big change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至是一个时代的结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The end of an era, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.07,0:17:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  眼睛都没眨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay? You're not blinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好  我只是在想一个时代要结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm fine. I was thinking about how it's an end of an era.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但老实说  六年应该称不上一个时代\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But y’know I gotta say, I don’t, I don’t think six years counts as an era.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个时代就是一段重要的日子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}An era is defined as a significant period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得重要  或许你不觉得重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was significant for me. Maybe it wasn't significant to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么了  你刚才怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is the matter with you? What is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么没有更不开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why aren't you more upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要分开了  你不难过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aren’t you gonna be sad that we’re not gonna be living together anymore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都不会想我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aren't you gonna miss me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  说出来你别生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, all right. But don't get mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是有点难以相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just a little hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以相信什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's hard to believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们啊  你们就是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it's you guys. You do this kind of stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在赌城说要结婚  又不结了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were gonna get married in Vegas, and then you backed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不认为你们会真的同居  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not upset because I don't see you going through with it. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情已经确定了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德会搬进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler is gonna move in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.51,0:19:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  你先听我说完\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I-No, wait. Just let me finish, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是在赌城的一时冲动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't something that we just impulsively decided to do in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的想要住在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is something that we both really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会住在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it is going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再住在一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean, we're not gonna live together anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我会好想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I'm gonna miss you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个时代的结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it's the end of an era!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  又来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, bye. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去办注销了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did you get the annulment?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我办不了  我就知道   因为你爱瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't. I knew it. Because you love Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那样的  事情比想像中复杂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not that. Annulments are more complicated--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱让它变得复杂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Complicated because of the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不爱瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I… I do, I do not love Rachel..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.37,0:20:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就去告诉她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I’m gonna tell her right now about the whole thing ...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好尽快把手续办好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so we can get this marriage annulled as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我如果爱她  会这么做吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Would I do that if I loved her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在更确信你爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never been more convinced of your love for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对瑞秋没有感觉  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do not have feelings for Rachel, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和钱德真的要同居了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica and Chandler are moving in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得搬出去  一切都要变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I have to move out and everything is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来  别难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my, come here, come here. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯和瑞秋结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Ross and Rachel got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和钱德差点结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica and Chandler almost got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:20:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要不要也勾搭勾搭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think you and I should hook up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.71,0:21:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, we do. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不是现在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  那是什么时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Well, when?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  钱德和摩妮卡会结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem, well, first Chandler and Monica will get married...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还会发大财\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and be filthy rich, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但婚姻会破裂  天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it won't work out. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我会为钱嫁给钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then I'm gonna marry Chandler for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会娶瑞秋生几个漂亮小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you'll marry Rachel and have the beautiful kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接着我们就抛弃他们结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But then we ditch those two and we get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.16,0:21:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会有钱德的财产  瑞秋的孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll have Chandler's money and Rachel's kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,监护权很好抢  因为瑞秋酗酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Getting custody will be easy because of Rachel's drinking problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那罗斯呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, ooh, what about Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想多说  不过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to go into the whole thing, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们吵架  我杀了他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we have words and I kill him.
